### List refunds
GET http://localhost:5000/api/refunds?page=1&limit=10

### Search refunds
GET http://localhost:5000/api/refunds?q=DKRE-1001

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/refunds/refunds-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference": "DKRE-1002",
  "booking": "DKB-1002",
  "amount": 249,
  "reason": "Duplicate payment",
  "status": "pending"
}
